  "summary": "Based in Orange County, California.\n\nApplication Specialist for JigsawTek Corporation as of August 2022.\n\nWeb Front-end dev and  .NET Full Stack dev.  Angular, TypeScript, C#, and MS SQL Server, Graphics creation, Amazon Web Services.\n\nExtensive experience creating solutions with .NET 7, and .NET Core Frameworks, Javascript, HTTP, HTML, CSS, C#, VB.NET, SQL, .NET Entity Framework, and .NET Web API.\n\nExperienced with Single Page Application (SPA) technologies such as Angular (thru Angular 17 / Angular CLI / Angular SSR), Google Material Design, Typescript, SASS, and XML.\n\nArtist’s eye in building UI, including using Adobe tools such as Photoshop.\n\nI respect the importance of Security to a business and will carefully follow best security practices established by the development team, but I am not personally an expert in security.\n\nI've done a few small things in Azure and AWS, but in general I have limited experience in Cloud technologies.   I haven't yet worked on a project that used a Microservices approach, or CI/CD.",
